  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebApplication\",\n  \"name\": \"MOMUTO 3D Soccer Jersey Designer\",\n  \"url\": \"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html\",\n  \"applicationCategory\": \"DesignApplication\",\n  \"operatingSystem\": \"Web browser\",\n  \"offers\": { \"@type\": \"Offer\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"description\": \"Free to design. Jerseys from $25.90 at 10+ units if you order.\" },\n  \"publisher\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"MOMUTO\", \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com\" }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is the 3D soccer jersey designer free?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. The designer is free to use — design, preview and share as much as you want. You only pay if you order: jerseys from $25.90 each at 10 or more, $45.90 for a single jersey. No account needed to start.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do I start from a blank jersey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No — and that is the point. Every Ready to Play design loads finished, in a colorway chosen by our design studio. You recolor it, change the pattern, add your crest, sponsor, name and number. Start from something good and make it yours.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there a minimum order?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No minimum. Order one jersey or a full roster. Pricing scales with quantity: $45.90 for a single jersey, from $25.90 each at 10 or more.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is Ready to Play?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ready to Play is this wall — finished designs our design studio stands behind, every one customizable in 3D or ready to order as it stands. Each season we pick a few on-trend designs and run them at −10%; the selection rotates, the designs stay.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I upload my own crest and sponsor logos?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. Upload your team crest and sponsor logos directly in the 3D designer and place them live on the jersey. Names and numbers for the whole roster are added at order time.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does delivery take?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Production takes 7–12 days and shipping 10–15 days — typically 25–30 days door to door in the US. Every jersey is full-sublimation printed on polyester-elastane fabric.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is this a soccer jersey generator?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — with one difference. A typical jersey generator hands you a blank template and basic color fills. MOMUTO's 3D designer starts every design finished — recolor it, add your crest, sponsor, names and numbers — and anything you generate can be manufactured and delivered, typically 25–30 days door to door. Already generated a design elsewhere (ChatGPT, Midjourney)? Our designers rebuild it as a real jersey.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"I have an AI concept or a sketch — can you make it real?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — that is our Bespoke service. Send a ChatGPT or Midjourney render, a sketch or a moodboard, and our designers rebuild it as a production-ready jersey. First mockup in 24–48h; $15 deposit, credited in full to orders of 5 or more jerseys.\" }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" />\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg-primary: #0a0a0a; --bg-panel: #101010; --bg-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\n    --text-white: #f5f5f5; --text-muted: #a1a1aa; --text-dim: #71717a;\n    --accent-red: #c8352e; --accent-red-hover: #e04038;\n    --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    --font-display: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; --font-body: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  }\n  .studio-page * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .studio-page { background: var(--bg-primary); color: var(--text-white); font-family: var(--font-body); overflow-x: hidden; margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw); margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw); }\n  body { overflow-x: hidden; background: var(--bg-primary); color: var(--text-white); } /* paint the body itself: the wrapper chain clips the 100vw bleed, leaving white strips (see docs/cms-page-gotchas.md) */\n  .title, .page-title { display: none !important; } /* the CMS prints the page title above the content */\n\n  /* hero — tight; the grid is the page */\n  .st-hero { padding: 5.5rem 20px 3rem; text-align: center; }\n  .st-eyebrow { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }\n  .st-eyebrow b { color: var(--text-white); font-weight: 700; }\n  .st-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6.5vw, 4.8rem); font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em; line-height: 0.95; margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n  .st-hero h1 .free { color: var(--accent-red); }\n  .st-sub { font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 1.8rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .st-cta-row { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .st-btn { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 32px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; }\n  .st-btn-primary { background: var(--accent-red); color: #fff; }\n  .st-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-red-hover); }\n  .st-hero-note { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-dim); }\n  .mo-editor-reset .st-sub, .mo-editor-reset .st-final p { margin-inline: auto; } /* theme reset zeroes p margin-inline, killing margin:auto centering */\n\n  /* THE GRID — the workshop wall */\n  .st-wall { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 20px 4.5rem; }\n  .st-wall-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }\n  .st-wall-head h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }\n  .st-wall-head p { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-dim); }\n  .st-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; }\n  .st-card { display: block; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-white); background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .st-card-imgwrap { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow: hidden; background: #141414; }\n  .st-card-badge { position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 10px; z-index: 1; background: var(--accent-red); color: #fff; font-size: 0.64rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 9px; }\n  .st-card-imgwrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.4s ease; }\n  .st-card:hover .st-card-imgwrap img { transform: scale(1.04); }\n  .st-card-meta { padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem 1rem; }\n  .st-card-name { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }\n  .st-card-style { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 3px 8px; }\n  .st-card-open { display: block; margin-top: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); }\n  .st-card:hover .st-card-open { color: var(--accent-red); }\n  .st-card-more { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; gap: 0.7rem; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.18); background: none; }\n  .st-card-more i { font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--text-dim); }\n  .st-card-more b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }\n  .st-card-more span { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.5; }\n  .st-card-more:hover { border-color: var(--accent-red); }\n  .st-wall-note { margin-top: 1.4rem; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-dim); text-align: center; }\n  .st-wall-note a { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }\n  .st-wall-note a:hover { color: var(--accent-red); }\n\n  /* never blank — one paragraph, workshop voice */\n  .st-blank { background: var(--bg-panel); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4rem 20px; }\n  .st-blank-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }\n  .st-h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n  .st-blank p { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }\n  .st-blank p strong { color: var(--text-white); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* stat strip */\n  .st-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 2px; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3.5rem 20px; }\n  .st-stat { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.3rem 1rem; text-align: center; }\n  .st-stat b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 400; }\n  .st-stat span { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); }\n\n  /* steps */\n  .st-how { background: var(--bg-panel); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4rem 20px; }\n  .st-how-inner { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .st-how .st-h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.4rem; }\n  ol.st-steps { list-style: none !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; }\n  ol.st-steps > li { display: flex !important; list-style: none !important; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: baseline; margin: 0 0 1.4rem !important; padding: 0 0 1.4rem !important; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  ol.st-steps > li::marker { content: none; }\n  ol.st-steps > li:last-child { border-bottom: none; margin-bottom: 0 !important; padding-bottom: 0 !important; }\n  .st-step-num { flex-shrink: 0; width: 2.2rem; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--text-dim); }\n  ol.st-steps > li > div strong { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.86rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }\n  ol.st-steps > li > div p { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 !important; }\n\n  /* doors */\n  .st-doors { padding: 4.5rem 20px; max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .st-doors .st-h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; }\n  .st-door { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.7rem 1.5rem; }\n  .st-door-solo { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }\n  .st-door h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }\n  .st-door p { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }\n  .st-door a { color: var(--accent-red); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }\n  .mo-editor-reset .st-door-solo { margin-inline: auto; } /* theme reset zeroes p margin-inline; keep the door card centered */\n\n  /* faq */\n  .st-faq { background: var(--bg-panel); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4.5rem 20px; }\n  .st-faq-inner { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .st-faq .st-h2 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; }\n  .st-faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem 0; }\n  .st-faq-item:first-of-type { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .st-faq-item h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }\n  .st-faq-item p { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; }\n\n  /* final */\n  .st-final { padding: 5rem 20px; text-align: center; }\n  .st-final p { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 1.8rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 1020px) { .st-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    /* mobile-first pass (14.08.2026): most traffic is mobile and the kits\n       are the product — tighter chrome, bigger frames, featured lead tile.\n       15.08: NO calc(50%-50vw) bleed on mobile — the live wrapper geometry\n       over-shifts it and clips the left edge (customer screenshot); the\n       body is painted dark so the bleed buys nothing here. Side gutters\n       come from the theme wrapper. */\n    .studio-page { margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; }\n    .st-hero { padding: 3.6rem 6px 2.2rem; }\n    .st-wall { padding: 1.6rem 0 3.5rem; }\n    .st-wall-head { margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; row-gap: 4px; }\n    /* badge off the collar: bottom-left, slimmer */\n    .st-card-badge { top: auto; bottom: 8px; left: 8px; font-size: 0.58rem; padding: 3px 7px; }\n    .st-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; }\n    /* the first design leads full-width — featured tile */\n    .st-grid .st-card:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n    .st-grid .st-card:first-child .st-card-imgwrap { aspect-ratio: 1/1; }\n    .st-grid .st-card:first-child .st-card-imgwrap img,\n    .st-grid .st-card:first-child:hover .st-card-imgwrap img { transform: none; }\n    /* square frames + slight zoom: the renders carry padding around the\n       jersey, so uncropped they read tiny at phone card widths */\n    .st-card-imgwrap { aspect-ratio: 1/1; }\n    .st-card-imgwrap img, .st-card:hover .st-card-imgwrap img { transform: scale(1.1); }\n    .st-card-meta { padding: 0.6rem 0.65rem 0.85rem; }\n    .st-card-name { font-size: 1.02rem; }\n    .st-card-style { margin-top: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.62rem; }\n    .st-card-open { margin-top: 0.45rem; font-size: 0.66rem; }\n    .st-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2px; padding: 2.5rem 0; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"studio-page\">\n\n<header class=\"st-hero\">\n  <p class=\"st-eyebrow\"><b>Ready to Play</b> &middot; MOMUTO 3D Soccer Jersey Designer</p>\n  <h1>Design your soccer uniform in 3D. <span class=\"free\">Free.</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"st-sub\">Every design below was finished by our design studio and is ready to play. Pick one, open it in 3D, and make it yours — colors, crest, sponsor, names and numbers, live on the jersey.</p>\n  <div class=\"st-cta-row\">\n    <a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"st-btn st-btn-primary\">Open the 3D designer &rarr;</a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"st-hero-note\">Free to design &bull; No account needed &bull; Order from 1 unit &bull; From $25.90 at 10+</p>\n</header>\n\n<section class=\"st-wall\">\n  <div class=\"st-wall-head\">\n    <h2>The designs</h2>\n    <p>Finished starting points &mdash; never a blank jersey</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"st-grid\">\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"/products/the-fracture\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><span class=\"st-card-badge\">&minus;10% &middot; This season</span><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/2f2d6a13dca63d7be0dba889582f997489692b268a1051c021a99b9623d40e4a.png\" alt=\"THE FRACTURE — geometric custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE FRACTURE</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Geometric shards</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">See the design &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"/products/the-apex\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><span class=\"st-card-badge\">&minus;10% &middot; This season</span><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20251204/3d9fea03f4408ada1395806d63127b14.webp\" alt=\"THE APEX — angular custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE APEX</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Angular panels</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">See the design &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"/products/the-kinetic\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><span class=\"st-card-badge\">&minus;10% &middot; This season</span><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/52561/cart/resources/20251201/12fc5c12474759b46ad5d5d04782b475.webp\" alt=\"THE KINETIC — motion lines custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE KINETIC</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Motion lines</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">See the design &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"/products/the-khala\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><span class=\"st-card-badge\">&minus;10% &middot; This season</span><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/368482b72b5c435b66cfbbabce8943e8ca57434ee5715699faf727aa36709d72.png\" alt=\"THE KHALA — bold panel custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE KHALA</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Bold side panels</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">See the design &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"/products/the-legacy\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><span class=\"st-card-badge\">&minus;10% &middot; This season</span><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20251203/04c885bb3c4378f460de42af9a8a3db2.webp\" alt=\"THE LEGACY — retro striped custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE LEGACY</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Heritage stripes</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">See the design &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"/products/the-prism\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><span class=\"st-card-badge\">&minus;10% &middot; This season</span><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/8861a904ded03b3141c5878a5b9d6fc864330eee737204b3d186d724d6c82c51.png\" alt=\"THE PRISM — faceted geometry custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE PRISM</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Faceted geometry</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">See the design &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"/products/the-mosaic\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><span class=\"st-card-badge\">&minus;10% &middot; This season</span><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/ae9deb9e17f800bd3140e6d66fb130a31813b202b8bf60485eea441fe361ebc5.png\" alt=\"THE MOSAIC — tiled pattern custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE MOSAIC</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Tiled pattern</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">See the design &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-crossband.png\" alt=\"THE CROSSBAND — sash custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE CROSSBAND</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Sash</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-cascade.png\" alt=\"THE CASCADE — gradient striped custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE CASCADE</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Gradient stripes</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-phantom-camo.png\" alt=\"THE PHANTOM CAMO — abstract camo custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE PHANTOM CAMO</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Abstract camo</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-jungle.png\" alt=\"THE JUNGLE — jungle print custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE JUNGLE</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Jungle print</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-snake.png\" alt=\"THE SNAKE — snakeskin gradient custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE SNAKE</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Snakeskin gradient</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-eclipse.png\" alt=\"THE ECLIPSE — shoulder stripe custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE ECLIPSE</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Shoulder stripes</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-warp.png\" alt=\"THE WARP — warped pinstripe custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE WARP</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Warped pinstripes</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-strata.png\" alt=\"THE STRATA — layered texture custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE STRATA</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Layered texture</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <div class=\"st-card-imgwrap\"><img src=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/asset/finder/the-synth.png\" alt=\"THE SYNTH — circuit stripe custom soccer jersey design, customizable in 3D\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"640\"></div>\n      <span class=\"st-card-meta\"><span class=\"st-card-name\">THE SYNTH</span><span class=\"st-card-style\">Circuit stripes</span><span class=\"st-card-open\">Open in 3D &rarr;</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"st-card st-card-more\" href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\">\n      <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i>\n      <b>More designs</b>\n      <span>Every design loads finished. Open the 3D designer and scroll the design menu.</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"st-wall-note\">Each season our design studio picks a few of these that are on trend and runs them at &minus;10% &mdash; they wear the badge. The selection rotates; the designs stay.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"st-blank\">\n  <div class=\"st-blank-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"st-h2\">You never start from a blank jersey</h2>\n    <p>Most jersey generators hand you an empty shape in a default color and wish you luck. MOMUTO doesn&rsquo;t. <strong>Every design loads finished</strong> — a pattern, a palette, a look our designers already stand behind. Your job isn&rsquo;t to be a designer; it&rsquo;s to <strong>make a good design yours</strong>: your colors, your crest, your sponsor, your names and numbers. Soccer today &mdash; basketball is new to the designer too.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"st-stats\">\n  <div class=\"st-stat\"><b>30+</b><span>Finished designs</span></div>\n  <div class=\"st-stat\"><b>Live</b><span>Real-time 3D preview</span></div>\n  <div class=\"st-stat\"><b>1</b><span>Minimum order</span></div>\n  <div class=\"st-stat\"><b>25&ndash;30</b><span>Days, door to door</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"st-how\">\n  <div class=\"st-how-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"st-h2\">From idea to matchday</h2>\n    <ol class=\"st-steps\">\n      <li><span class=\"st-step-num\">1</span><div><strong>Pick a starting design</strong><p>Choose from the wall above, or scroll the full design menu inside the 3D designer.</p></div></li>\n      <li><span class=\"st-step-num\">2</span><div><strong>Make it yours</strong><p>Colors, pattern, crest, sponsors, names and numbers — all live in 3D, all free, for as long as you like. Share it with your team before you decide.</p></div></li>\n      <li><span class=\"st-step-num\">3</span><div><strong>Order from one unit</strong><p>$45.90 for a single jersey, from $25.90 each at 10+. Full-sublimation print on polyester-elastane, delivered nationwide in 25&ndash;30 days.</p></div></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"st-doors\">\n  <h2 class=\"st-h2\">Rather have it designed for you?</h2>\n  <div class=\"st-door st-door-solo\">\n    <h3>Bespoke</h3>\n    <p>Have an AI concept, a sketch, or an idea no design can hold? Our designers build it for you. $15 deposit, credited in full from 5 jerseys.</p>\n    <a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\">Send your concept &rarr;</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"st-doors\">\n  <h2 class=\"st-h2\">Basketball</h2>\n  <div class=\"st-door st-door-solo\">\n    <h3>New to MOMUTO</h3>\n    <p>Basketball jerseys just landed in the 3D designer — the body is ready, and there&rsquo;s no catalog of finished basketball designs yet, so this is a design-your-own start.</p>\n    <div class=\"st-cta-row\" style=\"margin-top:0.4rem;margin-bottom:0.9rem;\">\n      <a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;suitName=mamuto3basket3&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"st-btn st-btn-primary\">Design a basketball jersey in 3D &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"/pages/custom-basketball-jerseys\">More on custom basketball jerseys &rarr;</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"st-faq\">\n  <div class=\"st-faq-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"st-h2\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>Is the 3D soccer jersey designer free?</h3><p>Yes. The designer is free to use — design, preview and share as much as you want. You only pay if you order: jerseys from $25.90 each at 10 or more, $45.90 for a single jersey. No account needed to start.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>Do I start from a blank jersey?</h3><p>No — and that&rsquo;s the point. Every Ready to Play design loads finished, in a colorway chosen by our design studio. You recolor it, change the pattern, add your crest, sponsor, name and number. Start from something good and make it yours.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>Is there a minimum order?</h3><p>No minimum. Order one jersey or a full roster. Pricing scales with quantity: $45.90 for a single jersey, from $25.90 each at 10 or more.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>What is Ready to Play?</h3><p>Ready to Play is this wall — finished designs our design studio stands behind, every one customizable in 3D or ready to order as it stands. Each season we pick a few on-trend designs and run them at &minus;10%; the selection rotates, the designs stay.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>Can I upload my own crest and sponsor logos?</h3><p>Yes. Upload your team crest and sponsor logos directly in the 3D designer and place them live on the jersey. Names and numbers for the whole roster are added at order time.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>How long does delivery take?</h3><p>Production takes 7&ndash;12 days and shipping 10&ndash;15 days — typically 25&ndash;30 days door to door in the US. Every jersey is full-sublimation printed on polyester-elastane fabric.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>Is this a soccer jersey generator?</h3><p>Yes — with one difference. A typical jersey generator hands you a blank template and basic color fills. MOMUTO&rsquo;s 3D designer starts every design finished — recolor it, add your crest, sponsor, names and numbers — and anything you generate can be manufactured and delivered, typically 25&ndash;30 days door to door. Already generated a design elsewhere (ChatGPT, Midjourney)? Our designers rebuild it as a real jersey.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"st-faq-item\"><h3>I have an AI concept or a sketch — can you make it real?</h3><p>Yes — that&rsquo;s our <a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" style=\"color:var(--accent-red);font-weight:600;\">Bespoke service</a>. Send a ChatGPT or Midjourney render, a sketch or a moodboard, and our designers rebuild it as a production-ready jersey. First mockup in 24&ndash;48h; $15 deposit, credited in full to orders of 5 or more jerseys.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"st-final\">\n  <h2 class=\"st-h2\">Your jersey is a few minutes away</h2>\n  <p>Open the designer, pick a starting design, and see your team&rsquo;s colors on it before you&rsquo;ve finished your coffee.</p>\n  <div class=\"st-cta-row\">\n    <a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"st-btn st-btn-primary\">Open the 3D designer &rarr;</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</div>",
